Package: litreview
Title: Get Literature, Make Bibliographies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Benjamin", "Harrap", , "benjamin.harrap@anu.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: litreview contains a suite of functions to make the process of gathering academic literature, compiling bibliographies, and note-taking easier. Based on Digital Object Identifiers (DOIs), litreview can check if an article is open-access and, if possible, download a PDF copy. It also assists in compiling bibliographies and can open PDFs in RStudio's Viewer window, allowing you to have markdown documents and the literature side-by-side.
